-- Scheduling reproducer: independent map lanes update private local arrays.
-- FIXED with checkout a151de4d on 2026-10-08: 64-thread compute kernel;
-- all 4097 rows verified on NVIDIA GTX 1660 Ti.
-- Expected: parallel map; row i has i at index i%4 and -1 elsewhere.
-- Inspect generated .wynhost
-- and SPIR-V for a one-invocation "ordered" loop over all 4097 rows.
-- wyn build fluid-simulation/test/repro_local_array_map.wyn -o /tmp/local-array-map.spv
entry reproduce() [][4]i32 =
  map(|i| let a = replicate(4,-1i32) in a with [i%4] = i,0i32..<4097)
